					"id": 150400701,
					"content": "我們到了，這就是「飄飄巡風阿夏」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "提可菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400702,
					"content": "哇噢，太酷了！近看它居然那麼大…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400703,
					"content": "噴繪上顏色之後，即使站在很遠的地方，也能眺望到它吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400704,
					"content": "當然，只要地形開闊，不被山體遮擋，無論是從呼呼丘的屋頂泳池，還是提提島那邊的峽灣，全都看得到！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "提可菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400705,
					"content": "真為你們驕傲。好好發揮啊，兩位！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400706,
					"content": "啊…我已經開始激動了，要用什麼顏色好呢…我的幸運色？還是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400707,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿夏"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400708,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿夏"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400709,
					"content": "♪~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿夏"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400710,
					"content": "唔，它這是一口氣說了好長一段話？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400711,
					"content": "恰斯卡，妳看著的吧？再替大家翻譯翻譯呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400712,
					"content": "嗯…資訊量太多，我得算算到底有多少種可能性…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恰斯卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400713,
					"content": "#我想我明白了它的意思。阿夏是想和我組隊，和{NICKNAME}比拼一番。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400714,
					"content": "它喜歡和朋友合作，共同幫助有需要的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400715,
					"content": "但具備競技性的挑戰才會讓平凡的活動變成令人興奮不已的冒險，它很享受這份刺激。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400716,
					"content": "它…它真說了那麼多？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400717,
					"content": "哈哈，大致是！也加入了我自己的理解。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400718,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿夏"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400719,
					"content": "看這反應好像是說中了，他們的感情還真是越來越好了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400720,
					"content": "#好啦，阿夏，雖然我和你有著相同的想法…但我們不該讓{NICKNAME}遷就我們的喜好，對嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400721,
					"content": "要認真尊重朋友的心情和意見喔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400722
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400722,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400723,
						150400726,
						150400729
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿夏"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400723,
					"content": "早就想挑戰團長了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400724
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150400724,
					"content": "#「那我接受{F#妳}{M#你}的挑戰。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400725,
					"content": "#啊哈哈…看到{F#妳}{M#你}的表情，我實在沒辦法把這句話說出氣勢來啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400732
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400732,
					"content": "兩邊的參賽選手都準備好了嗎？那就跟我來吧，由我擔任裁判。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "提可菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400726,
					"content": "只要班尼特和阿夏開心就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400727
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150400727,
					"content": "#不行，只有我們開心是不夠的！{NICKNAME}，我希望{F#妳}{M#你}也能享受其中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400728
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400728,
					"content": "來吧！不要有壓力，玩得開心最重要！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400732
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400729,
					"content": "你們五個都上我也不會輸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400730
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150400730,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}很有自信啊！好！那我也要使出全力了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400731
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400731,
					"content": "#喂！我可一直都是和{F#妳}{M#你}一隊的呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400732
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
